{"body":{"model":"sonnet","reads":{"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000000"},"seedFrom":"outside","top":{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DD"},"understandings":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E9"}]},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DC","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000J"],"name":"branch-15"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much freedom the parts keep against how much unity the whole gets","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E5"}],"prose":"The paper keeps asking how many autonomous parts can behave as one whole when nobody holds the whole. Its answers are specialised roles, meaning negotiated at runtime, and simulation that both mirrors and steers the system, tried on one rural case.","title":"Coherence without a centre"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DD","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction authority flows between levels","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DH"}],"prose":"What a holon is and where the idea came from: a thing that is whole and part at once, stacked in levels, carried from factories out into other infrastructure.","title":"The nested part-whole ground"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DE","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where authority sits relative to autonomy","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000116"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"}],"prose":"Holons sit in a holarchy, free locally and bound upward, unlike flat agents and unlike rigid hierarchies. Humans and orchestrators can take places in it.","title":"Nested autonomy"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DF","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the idea travels beyond its first domain","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"The idea passes from Koestler to manufacturing, then to grids, construction and cyber-physical settings, each time as a way to manage complexity.","title":"A lineage widening outward"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DG","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what is already held versus what is missing","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000MX"}],"prose":"Earlier work on holon frameworks, awareness and understanding dictionaries is cited, with a gap left in large-scale cross-system cooperation, and a map of what follows.","title":"Prior pieces the paper builds on"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DH","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which lack is named, and whether a remedy answers it","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DM"}],"prose":"Autonomous systems are taken to fall short in four ways, and pairing holons with AI and twins is offered as the remedy.","title":"The felt shortfalls and the promise of union"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the kind of harm a lack lets through","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"}],"prose":"Rigid adaptation, embedded bias, thin ethical reasoning and shallow situational awareness, each stated as a risk to people and to trust.","title":"Four named lacks"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DK","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how well the two supply what the other lacks","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"Twins and AI supply live data, learning and resilience, and holons supply distributed responsibility, so each covers the other's weak side. Ethical safeguards matter more where authority is spread out.","title":"Why holons, AI and twins fit"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DM","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether each role closes a distinct gap","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DT"}],"prose":"Five capacities are drawn out as kinds of holon, and each is described by the gap it answers, how it could be built, where it applies and what makes it hard. They check and feed one another and a watching layer ties them together.","title":"A family of complementary roles"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DN","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how a norm becomes something checkable","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"}],"prose":"Ethical and unbiased holons hold judgement over right and wrong and over fairness, using ontologies of norms and of bias patterns plus audits.","title":"Roles that hold values"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DP","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the horizon a decision is made across","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004BS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"}],"prose":"Effective holons look past quick efficiency to long-term consequence, and understanding holons turn varied data into situational meaning through ontologies and reasoning.","title":"Roles that hold capability"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DQ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how far awareness is shared across the whole","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"Vigilant holons spread awareness across levels so that locally informed parts do not drift apart globally.","title":"The role of shared watching"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DR","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"who supplies whom","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"Value holons pass verdicts to the effective ones, understanding feeds both, and vigilance runs through all layers, so autonomy and collective aims hold together.","title":"How the roles lean on each other"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DS","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"claim strength versus concreteness","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"}],"prose":"Each role is introduced as a response to a stated gap, and the paper treats them as analytic constructs rather than finished implementations.","title":"The shared frame of the roles"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DT","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether differences are removed or bridged","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E0"}],"prose":"Because holons differ in vocabulary, model and owner, they need a way to interoperate that leaves their autonomy intact. The paper's answer is a particular holon built for the job.","title":"Meaning crossing boundaries"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DV","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what each approach costs in independence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"Interoperability is a requirement; it is classed by barrier, concern and approach, and the federated approach alone leaves each party its own structure.","title":"Why union by federation"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DW","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how long a shared meaning has to last","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006F3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006JR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006P5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006T6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"On-the-fly alignment lets a newcomer be understood without prior agreement, through temporary ontologies that are made, used and dropped.","title":"Agreement made at the moment of need"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DX","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much the mediator may reshape connections","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"The Federated Interoperability Holon sits above the roles, brokering translation, goals, data and conflicts, and is built of six components (orchestrator, integrator, translator, finder, generator, executor), with the last two optional.","title":"The mediating holon and its parts"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DY","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which role answers which duty","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"}],"prose":"The mediator needs unbiased holons for retrieval, ethical checks on outputs, and vigilant holons as orchestrators, so the earlier roles become its subparts.","title":"How the mediator draws on the roles"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DZ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"scope claimed versus scope left to others","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"Examples in cities and supply chains, the limits of standards, scale and security, and a statement that the work targets meaning and organisation, with technical layers assumed.","title":"Where it applies and what limits it"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E0","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the holons control the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E4"}],"prose":"The paper stretches agent-directed simulation into holon-directed simulation, where holons act in a run and also steer it.","title":"Simulation that directs"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E1","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what holons add to the agent case","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"}],"prose":"Three agent-and-simulation pairings, with emergence examples, give the base, and holons add levels and organisational awareness.","title":"Lineage from agent-directed simulation"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E2","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of influence over the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"}],"prose":"A ladder from passive source through reactive and adaptive to proactive, graded by the autonomy of the holons.","title":"Kinds of holon-directed simulation"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E3","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what the idea costs to run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"}],"prose":"It needs real-time adaptation, coordination, and federation, and it faces cost, standards and integration with learning and twins.","title":"What it asks for"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E4","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the case exercises the whole framework","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E9"}],"prose":"Rural mobility serves as the case: a sparse setting that needs coordination of many services and finds places with no transport.","title":"One concrete place"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E5","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what the setting demands","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"}],"prose":"Low density and cost make centralised transport fail, and the platform must gather data, coordinate providers, locate deserts, adapt and validate by simulation.","title":"The problem and its asks"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E6","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which holon plays which part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"Each role gets a job in the transport flow, from travellers to infrastructure monitors, under the mediating holon at the top.","title":"Roles placed in the scene"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E7","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how test and real system stay linked","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"Under the HLA, holons run as federates with a limited manager that serves as both authority in the run and part of the real system. Errors are flagged upward and a closing analysis feeds back.","title":"The same holons as federates"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E8","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much the case supports versus how much remains to test","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000002"}],"prose":"It is said to show scalability, flexibility, fairness and lower emissions, while being only an illustration, with validation and other domains left for later.","title":"What the case is said to show"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E9","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}